(Now let's construct the plan step by step.)
(We'll need to refer to objects precisely.)
(Objects:)
(- origin_availability_alpha (type origin_candidate_availability))
(- destination_availability_alpha (type destination_candidate_availability))
(- shift_candidate_alpha, shift_candidate_beta (schedule_candidate))
(- vehicle_unit_alpha, vehicle_unit_beta, vehicle_unit_gamma)
(- route_task_profile_alpha)
(- driver_operator_alpha (operator_resource))
(- cargo_payload_alpha)
(- origin_node_alpha, destination_node_alpha)
(- transport_leg_alpha)
(- loading_container_alpha, loading_container_beta)
(- equipment_resource_alpha, equipment_resource_beta (we may not use))
(- service_window_alpha, service_window_beta)
(- dispatch_slot_alpha)
(- skill_certificate_alpha)
(- operational_constraint_alpha, operational_constraint_beta (we may not use))
(- compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now we need to create candidates:)
(Action: create_candidate ?candidate)
(We need to create origin_availability_alpha, destination_availability_alpha, shift_candidate_alpha. Also maybe shift_candidate_beta not needed.)
