(- allocate_vehicle_unit ?candidate ?vehicle_unit)
(We need to allocate vehicle to origin_availability_alpha (vehicle_unit_alpha), to destination_availability_alpha (vehicle_unit_gamma), to shift_candidate_alpha (vehicle_unit_beta). We'll decide.)
(Thus:)
(4. allocate_vehicle_unit origin_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_alpha)
(5. allocate_vehicle_unit destination_availability_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma)
(6. allocate_vehicle_unit shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_beta)
(Now attach task profile to origin_availability_alpha (for confirm_preparedness):)
(7. attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now confirm candidate preparedness for origin_availability_alpha:)
(8. confirm_candidate_preparedness origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now assign operator resource to origin_availability_alpha:)
(9. assign_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now load origin payload:)
(10. load_origin_payload origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha cargo_payload_alpha)
(Now lock origin availability:)
(11. lock_origin_availability origin_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now release operator from origin_availability_alpha (to reuse):)
(12. release_operator_resource origin_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now we need to prepare destination_availability_alpha:)
(Attach task profile to destination_availability_alpha:)
(13. attach_task_profile destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Confirm candidate preparedness for destination_availability_alpha:)
(14. confirm_candidate_preparedness destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Assign operator resource to destination_availability_alpha:)
(15. assign_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Activate destination node:)
(16. activate_destination_node destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Lock destination availability:)
(17. lock_destination_availability destination_availability_alpha destination_node_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Release operator from destination_availability_alpha (optional, but we will need operator for shift candidate later; we can release now and reassign later):)
(18. release_operator_resource destination_availability_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Now we have origin and destination processed.)
(Now we need to process shift_candidate_alpha.)
(Attach task profile to shift_candidate_alpha:)
(19. attach_task_profile shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Confirm candidate preparedness for shift_candidate_alpha:)
(20. confirm_candidate_preparedness shift_candidate_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Assign operator resource to shift_candidate_alpha:)
(21. assign_operator_resource shift_candidate_alpha driver_operator_alpha)
(Assign skill certificate to shift_candidate_alpha:)
(22. assign_skill_certificate shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha)
(Assign compliance certificate to shift_candidate_alpha:)
(23. assign_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now we need to reserve equipment? Not needed.)
(Now we need to load container onto leg: but first we need to authorize transport leg loading.)
(We need to have transport_leg assembled; but we haven't assembled yet. So we need to assemble transport leg first.)
(But we need origin_availability_locked and destination_availability_locked (we have). Also need origin_availability_node_linked, destination_availability_node_linked (we have from init). Need origin_node_ready and destination_node_ready. Origin_node_ready we have from load_origin_payload (set origin_node_ready true). Destination_node_ready we have from activate_destination_node (set destination_node_ready true). Good.)
(Now assemble_transport_leg:)
(24. assemble_transport_leg origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha origin_node_alpha destination_node_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now authorize transport leg loading:)
(25. authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now load container onto leg:)
(We need loading_container_available; we have loading_container_alpha available. candidate_loading_container_linked shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha (from init). candidate_transport_leg_linked shift_candidate_alpha transport_leg_alpha (from init). So:)
(26. load_container_onto_leg shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now stage schedule candidate:)
(27. stage_schedule_candidate shift_candidate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now verify loading profile nominal:)
(Need candidate_skill_certificate_linked (we assigned), candidate_operator_linked (we assigned), candidate_loading_container_linked (we have), loading_container_leg_linked (we just set), not destination_leg_loaded (we haven't loaded destination leg), not candidate_loading_verified.)
(Thus:)
(28. verify_loading_profile_nominal shift_candidate_alpha skill_certificate_alpha driver_operator_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now establish clearance nominal:)
(Need candidate_loading_verified true (we just set), candidate_compliance_certificate_linked (we assigned), candidate_loading_container_linked, loading_container_leg_linked, not origin_leg_loaded, not destination_leg_loaded, not candidate_clearance_established.)
(Thus:)
(29. establish_clearance_nominal shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha loading_container_alpha transport_leg_alpha)
(Now release compliance certificate (to make it available again):)
(30. release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha)
(Now attach service window:)
(Need service_window_available (we have service_window_alpha and service_window_beta). We'll use service_window_alpha.)
(31. attach_service_window shift_candidate_alpha service_window_alpha)
(Now validate route sequence:)
(Need candidate_clearance_established true, route_sequence_context_set true (set by establish_clearance_nominal), candidate_service_window_linked true (we just attached), candidate_origin_availability_linked true (from init), candidate_destination_availability_linked true (from init), origin_availability_confirmed true (we have), destination_availability_confirmed true (we have), candidate_task_profile_linked true (we attached earlier), not route_sequence_validated.)
(Thus:)
(32. validate_route_sequence shift_candidate_alpha origin_availability_alpha destination_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha service_window_alpha)
(Now finalize candidate after sequence validation:)
(33. finalize_candidate_after_sequence_validation shift_candidate_alpha)
(Now allocate dispatch slot for shift_candidate_alpha:)
(Need dispatch_ready ?candidate (set by finalize), candidate_task_profile_linked (still true), dispatch_slot_available (we have dispatch_slot_alpha), not dispatch_allocated.)
(Thus:)
(34. allocate_dispatch_slot_for_candidate shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha route_task_profile_alpha)
(Now execute schedule dispatch:)
(Need dispatch_allocated ?candidate (true), candidate_vehicle_linked ?candidate ?vehicle_unit (we allocated vehicle_unit_beta earlier), candidate_dispatch_slot_linked ?candidate ?dispatch_slot (true), not dispatched.)
(Thus:)
(35. execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_beta dispatch_slot_alpha)
(Now we have dispatched shift_candidate_alpha.)
(Now we need to dispatch origin_availability_alpha.)
(We have origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true, transport_leg_assembled true, transport_leg_loading_authorized true, not dispatch_ready? Actually we haven't marked origin availability dispatch ready yet. We need to run mark_origin_availability_dispatch_ready.)
(Precondition: origin_availability_locked, origin_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_loading_authorized, not dispatch_ready.)
